<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3351/56  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5120/25  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.6953/58  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.2675/80  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     31.14/18   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.1162/72  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1519.5/0.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.18/23  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.5925/00  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.3575/95  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.8110/30  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4070/77  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7866/71  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7321/26  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6395/00</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$378.60/379.10</p>
</text>
